<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Morgan Stanley AG says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Novartis.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE	  ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A    1,520.00 SFR  15.44 SFR     9.80 PCT     9.87 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B    1,600.00 SFR  12.05 SFR    12.82 PCT    12.66 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.FEB.97-07.JUL.98   PAYDATE	07.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,525.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
